SUMMARY:20s & 30s August Social at Kimball Farm in Lancaster\, MA
LOCATION:1543 Lunenburg R\nLancaster\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday\, August 4\, 2026 | 6:00 PM\nhttps://activities.outdoo
 rs.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001DN1R2AW/\nWhat's better than ice cream and
  dinner outside on a (hopefully) nice summer day? Join the Worcester 20s &
  30s group on Tuesday August 4th at Kimball Farm in Lancaster\, MA! This e
 vent is perfect for both folks new to AMC and returners alike - this is a 
 great opportunity to get to know members of our group and learn more about
  upcoming events.We will be there starting at 6pm\, but feel free to come 
 whenever (let me know if you won’t get there until after 8pm though). Ic
 e cream and food items from the Grill & Seafood menu are available for pur
 chase until 9pm. Hope to see you there!
